# Released checkpoints and their archives. A LoRA adapter is 160MB and its zip 122MB, and this
# repository already fails a push at 61MB without raising http.postBuffer, so an accidental
# `git add -A` here would be hard to undo. The artefacts live on the cluster under
# $SCRATCH/open-instruct/output and are reproducible from the training scripts.
ckpt/
*.zip

# LaTeX build products. The .tex and the figures it includes are the sources; these are
# regenerated by every pdflatex run and only ever show up as noise in a diff. The .pdf is
# deliberately NOT here, since it is what gets read without a TeX install.
projects/pedagogy_rm/paper/*.aux
projects/pedagogy_rm/paper/*.out
projects/pedagogy_rm/paper/*.log
